  "summary_md": "**AI Box ([@RUC_AIBox](https://x.com/RUC_AIBox/status/2116155115858223432))** rounds up six works on forecasting agents: outcome training (OpenForecaster's ~50K news questions, Mantic RL raising its Metaculus score from 38.6 to 45.8), time-aware evaluation (FutureSim's day-by-day replay exposing anchoring, Echo), and auditable reasoning (BLF belief states, AuditForecast adjustments) ([arXiv 2512.25070](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.25070), [arXiv 2609.05905](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.05905), [Thinking Machines](https://thinkingmachines.ai/news/training-llms-to-predict-world-events/), [Echo](https://unipat.ai/blog/Echo)).",
